                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Survey among the inhabitants of Almelo R. satisfied with neighbourhood, house, shopping, sports  facilities and sports clubs / all members of household:  which sports, how often /  R.'s opinions on, demand for, child-care.  R.'s opinion on traffic, safety, cleanliness, FC Heracles /\tr.'s opinion on and satisfaction with playgrounds, bottlebanks. Issues concerning the elderly: house, neighbourhood  suitable for elderly. Use of public transport / shopping,  distance to shops Background variables: basic characteristics/ residence/ housing situation/ household characteristics/ occupation/employment/ income/capital assets/ education/ religion/ organizational membership</p>"
